    "representation": "lean4-declaration",
    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem infinite_isWallSunSunPrime_of_disc_eq {D : ℕ} (hD₀ : 0 < D)\n    (hD : D ≡ 0 [MOD 4] ∨ D ≡ 1 [MOD 4]) :\n    {p : ℕ | ∃ a b : ℕ, a ^ 2 - 4 * b = D ∧ IsLucasWieferichPrime a b p}.Infinite",
